---
description: Require step-level tests and final integration tests
alwaysApply: true
---

When a step adds or changes logic:
- add or update unit tests where appropriate
- cover happy path, edge cases, and failure cases when reasonable
- keep unit tests scoped to the step

When a feature or milestone is complete:
- define or update integration tests for completed workflows
- validate service interactions, database behavior, and messaging/event flows where relevant

Prefer deterministic test verification over vague validation.
